00:00:54.979 --> 00:00:56.112
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE CIRCUMSTANCES

00:00:56.113 --> 00:00:57.513
ARE TRAGIC ON THEIR OWN BUT THE

00:00:57.514 --> 00:01:01.851
RUN UP TO IT IS EVEN MORE SO.

00:01:01.852 --> 00:01:02.819
TO DAYS BEFORE THIS REIGN OF

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.387
TERROR HE WAS ARRESTED BY THAT

00:01:04.388 --> 00:01:05.822
TO LAHR COUNTY SHERIFF'S

00:01:05.823 --> 00:01:08.291
