HE HAD A VIOLENT CRIMINAL PAST.

00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:28.511
&gt;&gt; THEY TELL FOX NEWS THAT

00:01:28.512 --> 00:01:29.913
GARCIA HAD BEEN DEPORTED TWICE.

00:01:29.914 --> 00:01:31.881
IN THE PAST THE SHERIFF'S OFFICE

00:01:31.882 --> 00:01:33.883
COULD HAVE ALERTED IMMIGRATION

00:01:33.884 --> 00:01:34.550
BECAUSE OF HIS EXTENSIVE RAP

00:01:34.551 --> 00:01:35.184
SHEET WHICH INCLUDED ARMED

00:01:35.185 --> 00:01:39.355
ROBBERY MORE THAN TWO YEARS AGO.

00:01:39.356 --> 00:01:42.325
&gt;&gt; YOU MIGHT BE WONDERING WHY

00:01:42.326 --> 00:01:44.894
THE COPS LET HIM GO.

00:01:44.895 --> 00:01:47.530
WAS IT THE POLICE'S FAULT?

00:01:47.531 --> 00:01:48.331
&gt;&gt; ICE DID FOLLOW A DETAINER AS

00:01:48.332 --> 00:01:51.367
SOON AS IT LEARNED OF GARCIA'S

00:01:51.368 --> 00:01:53.536
