00:02:04.982 --> 00:02:07.483
&gt;&gt; SO OUR COUNTY SHERIFF SAID

00:02:07.484 --> 00:02:10.086
BEFORE SP 54 WHICH IS THE

00:02:10.087 --> 00:02:11.721
SANCTUARY STATE BILL, GUSTAVO

00:02:11.722 --> 00:02:13.122
GARCIA WOULD HAVE BEEN TURNED

00:02:13.123 --> 00:02:14.824
