00:02:14.825 --> 00:02:16.726
HOW WE HAVE ALWAYS DONE IT.

00:02:16.727 --> 00:02:20.129
BUT AFTER SP 54 WE KNOW LONGER

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:21.931
HAVE THE POWER TO DO THAT.

00:02:21.932 --> 00:02:23.099
WE SHOULD KNOW THE TWO

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:23.666
LARGE COUNTY BOARD OF

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:25.501
